1
00:00:00,035 --> 00:00:06,385
Suddenly a woman who had suffered from bleeding for twelve years came up behind Him and touched the fringe of His cloak.

2
00:00:06,989 --> 00:00:11,041
She said to herself, “If only I touch His cloak, I will be healed.”

3
00:00:11,736 --> 00:00:13,084
Jesus turned and saw her.

4
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:18,576
“Take courage, daughter,” He said, “your faith has healed you.” And the woman was healed from that very hour.

